    "Both keys are public halves. They are how other people encrypt to you, and they reveal nothing about your messages. Undelivered messages sit on the relay as sealed envelopes and are erased the moment your phone collects them. The notification token lets the relay ask Apple to wake your phone; turning off message notifications removes it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Both keys are public halves. They are how other people encrypt to you, and they reveal nothing about your messages. Undelivered messages sit on the relay as sealed envelopes and are erased the moment your phone collects them. The notification token lets the relay ask Apple to wake your phone; turning off message notifications removes it."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ambas as chaves são as metades públicas. São como as outras pessoas cifram para si e não revelam nada sobre as suas mensagens. As mensagens não entregues ficam no retransmissor como envelopes selados e são apagadas no momento em que o seu telefone as recolhe. O token de notificações permite ao retransmissor pedir à Apple que acorde o seu telefone; desligar as notificações de mensagens remove-o."
          }
        }
      }
    },
