    },
    "This can happen when someone reinstalls hoppin or changes phone. It can also mean someone is impersonating them." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This can happen when someone reinstalls hoppin or changes phone. It can also mean someone is impersonating them."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Isto pode acontecer quando alguém reinstala o hoppin ou muda de telemóvel. Também pode significar que alguém se está a fazer passar por essa pessoa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This can mean your conversation is being intercepted, or simply that one of you is looking at a different contact or an out-of-date screen. Don't send anything sensitive. Close and reopen this screen on both phones and scan again; if it still doesn't match, contact them another way before continuing." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This can mean your conversation is being intercepted, or simply that one of you is looking at a different contact or an out-of-date screen. Don't send anything sensitive. Close and reopen this screen on both phones and scan again; if it still doesn't match, contact them another way before continuing."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Isto pode significar que a sua conversa está a ser intercetada, ou simplesmente que um de vocês está a ver um contacto diferente ou um ecrã desatualizado. Não envie nada sensível. Feche e reabra este ecrã nos dois telemóveis e leia o código outra vez; se continuar a não coincidir, contacte essa pessoa por outra via antes de continuar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone. hoppin keeps no backup, not on the server and not in iCloud." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This cannot be undone. hoppin keeps no backup, not on the server and not in iCloud."
